## Venue

This year's conference will be held at the Convention Center of Zhongguancun National Independent Innovation Demonstration Zone (located at No. 2 Xinjian Gongmen Road, Haidian District, Beijing).
Nestled in the heart of Haidian District, Beijing, the Convention Center of Zhongguancun National Independent Innovation Demonstration Zone stands adjacent to the time-honored cultural scenic area...

