## Getting There

| Mode | Detail | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Taking a taxi | Search for "Zhongguancun National Innovation Demonstration Zone Conference Center". | |
| Taking the subway | Take Metro Line 16 to the "Wanquanheqiao" Station. Exit from Exit A, then walk about 700 meters (≈11 minutes) to reach the park. | |
| Location | [[]Zhongguancun National Zizhu Innovative Demonstration Area - Conference Center](https://maps.apple.com/) | |
